 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RUNNER"
   ],
   "text": "Raiders! From the west and the north.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RUNNER"
   ],
   "text": "Some with Dutch guns. Some with old house banners.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RUNNER"
   ],
   "text": "They strike near Padmini Amma's upper fields.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "They chose my fields. Of course they did.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Old men fight their wars in land they have never walked; young ones set torches where women count vines.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The timing is not an accident.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Someone has been counting our drills as carefully as we count their gossip.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "We cannot let them hold that strip. If they do, they have a knife at our throat.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Our horse cannot move at speed through those vines. The path is too narrow. The canal banks too soft.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Foot.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Foot will bleed in every bush. Every tree hides a musket. We will lose men in inches.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You have an alternative?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Burn it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (small, soft lettering)"
   ],
   "text": "Burn it?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Not all. A strip. Narrow. Enough to deprive them of cover along the canal.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Then they must choose. Retreat into the open where our horse can run, or stay and be flanked in smaller patches.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You speak of my vines as if they were scrub.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Today, to them, they are a shield. Tomorrow, if they live, they are coin.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I know what I am asking.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You know.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You do not feel.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If we do nothing, they will move along that corridor until they reach places where our walls are thin and our men few.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "They will write their own terms in our fields.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "If we burn, you carve a wound through my land that will take years to heal.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Pepper is not rice. It does not spring back in one season. You cut into my children and their children.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Amma, if we let them keep that corridor, they carve different wounds.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Through forts. Through houses. Through your own name, when they brag of having used your land to break the king.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Do it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "But do not pretend you did it to me without my consent.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Let every man who walks that blackened line in years to come know that I allowed it, and that I remember every step you take on it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I will ride there myself.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I will not ask another to light the first torch.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "If we hit them from here, we expose ourselves. They have too many places to hide.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We do not hit them here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We hit their shield.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You did what you said you would. You burned a strip. Not all. Enough.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "I rode there. I walked the black line. It runs like a mark across my land.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "For years, men will ask what happened there. I will tell them. They will ask why. I will tell them that too.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We stopped them. They will not use your vines as cover again.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "When the raiders burned your lower fields years ago, you called it an act of cowardice.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Today, I did it with a torch in my own hand. I do not know which ash is heavier.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "They burned to destroy. You burned to save.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "But ash tastes the same in my mouth, Ananthan. Do not expect me to distinguish the flavour.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (after a breath, a separate balloon)"
   ],
   "text": "I do not say you were wrong.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "If I thought there had been another way, I would be screaming now, not speaking.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "But do not expect me to thank you. There are wounds that are necessary and wounds that are kind. This was the first, not the second.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You have my word that the state will help replant.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Your word does not make plants grow faster.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "But perhaps it will keep some of my boys from having to sell their swords to men like Kollamkara when the hunger comes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You have chosen your side firmly now, Pillai.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "When Dutch, Mysore or your own hills come in force, you will be in front of the king's fort. You will not be standing on my verandah.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "I will remember that.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You carved your own mark into this land.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We carved it together. The king, Ramayyan, Padmini. I merely held the first torch.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Men like you always say that. You hide behind councils and shared decisions when the fire is yours.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "If a Dutchman had done what you did, you would have called him monster.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Because you did it for a king you respect, you call it necessity.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You think there was another choice?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "No.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "That is what angers me most. Sometimes, the only choices left are between a slow death and a quick burn.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You chose well for the kingdom. Badly for the house. As I knew you would.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "This does not make you evil. It makes you dangerous.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "To love you, as I do, is to love a man whose first instinct is to save the larger pattern, not the smaller square.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You once asked only for a corner of my house and a sliver of my heart. Today you carved a wound across my land instead.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You knew that before we stood before the goddess.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Of course. I married you with my eyes open.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I knew there would be days when you stood on the wall beside the king instead of on my verandah. I did not expect to like it when those days came.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "We will work together when it suits the land. We will stand in the same halls. We will share this house in name and in law.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "But do not ask me to pretend this scar is not also your work.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Some men are most useful when both sides believe they are theirs.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Do not trouble yourself with his accounts. I keep them for him.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And if he betrayed us?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Then I would know. And he would know that I know. That is usually enough.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  }
 ]
}